I think Expert level for melee is a DevTeam trap.  Moving missile
classes up to Expert is so powerful it is tempting to think that
moving a melee weapons class up to Exert will also give a huge
benefit.  Not so - The difference between Expert long sword and
Skilled long sword is tiny between throwing d2 Skilled daggers
and throwing d3 Expert daggers.

Because of issues like this I end up writing up a skill slot
strategy per class that I play.  What would I want at XP=30 and
what very rough order do I want to achieve it in.  For classes that
can get to Expert in dagger I want to spend more than half of my
slots on dagger until Expert.  Compare with classes that can
get to Expert at bow who often need to be strong before they
start multifire arrows so I only start #enhancing bow after about
XP=9 or 10.



